        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Schlage B252PD, Double Cylinder Gate Locks</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Schlage B252PD double cylinder deadlatch is for use on gates such as swimming pool gates, where self-latching is required. Ideal for community pool gates in apartment or condominium buildings. Fits 1-3/4\" thick doors. Available in satin chrome, bright brass, and oil rubbed bronze finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/gate-lock-single-cylinder-schlage-b250pd\"><b>Schlage B250PD Single Cylinder Gate Locks</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for Schlage B255PD Gate Lock:\r\n<ul> \r\n<li>5 pin solid brass lock cylinders, schlage \"C\"keyway.</li>\r\n<li>Night Latch Function (ANSI F03).</li>\r\n<li>ANSI/BHMA A156.2 Grade 2.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Double Cylinder Night Latch:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Backset: Optional 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Crossbore Hole: Fits 1-1/2\" Diameter Bore Hole. Optional adaptor kit for use with 2-1/8\" bore hole.</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Dead Latch Throw: 9/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSupplied with 2 keys standard. If you require a large quantity of additional keys when using this gate lock for apartment, condominium or community areas please <a href=\"/pages/contact\"><b>Contact Us</b></a>. \r\n</p>\r\n \r\n<p>\r\n<b>Fits 1-1/2\" Bore Hole</b>. If your bore hole is 2-1/8\" please add the optional Bore Hole Adaptor Kit below. \r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Gate Lock Double Cylinder, Schlage B252PD",
                "description": "Schlage B252PD Double Cylinder Gate Locks - The Schlage B252PD double cylinder deadlatch is for use on gates such as swimming pool gates, where self-latching is required. Ideal for community pool gates in apartment or condominium buildings. Fits 1-3/4 inch thick doors. Available in satin chrome, bright brass, and oil rubbed bronze finishes.",
